{
    "title": "Streamer Rush: Dress & Impress",
    "description": "Do you know what it takes to be a streamer? \r\nAre you ready to become the BEST STREAMER of the WORLD?\r\n\r\nIf you think you can accomplish these, then download Streamer Rush and start your journey to get millions of followers. Dress to Impress everyone!\r\n\r\nStreamer Rush simplifies the choices a content creator makes everyday and combines them with the most loved mechanics and minigames. Get ready to experience the rush of being a streamer like never before with Streamer Rush \u2013 the game that lets you become the world's best streamer and gain millions of followers! \r\nAs you progress through the game, you'll need to use the right filters and collect trending items to gain followers and increase your fame. But it's not just about the numbers \u2013 it's also about upgrading your clothes, items, and talents to stand out from the competition. This is why it's called dress to impress.\r\n\r\nThere are endless fun challenges to take and things to accomplish!\r\n -Do a twerk challenge with your Lover or Daddy!\r\n- Duets with the most hated and loved famous people!\r\n- Gain followers by using the right filters!\r\n- Collect trending items!\r\n\r\n...And much more\r\n\r\nBut it's not just about the fun and games \u2013 in Streamer Rush, you'll also be able to upgrade your clothes, items, and talents while earning money by increasing your followers with each run. The more followers you get, the closer you'll get to achieving your dream of becoming a true streamer.\r\n\r\nBut be careful \u2013 the path to becoming a successful streamer is full of challenges and obstacles. Will you rise to the top and achieve your goals, or will you fall to the wayside as a mere clout chaser? The choice is yours in Streamer Rush! Come find out!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you know what it takes to be a streamer? <br>Are you ready to become the BEST STREAMER of the WORLD?<br><br>If you think you can accomplish these, then download Streamer Rush and start your journey to get millions of followers. Dress to Impress everyone!<br><br>Streamer Rush simplifies the choices a content creator makes everyday and combines them with the most loved mechanics and minigames. Get ready to experience the rush of being a streamer like never before with Streamer Rush \u2013 the game that lets you become the world&#39;s best streamer and gain millions of followers! <br>As you progress through the game, you&#39;ll need to use the right filters and collect trending items to gain followers and increase your fame. But it&#39;s not just about the numbers \u2013 it&#39;s also about upgrading your clothes, items, and talents to stand out from the competition. This is why it&#39;s called dress to impress.<br><br>There are endless fun challenges to take and things to accomplish!<br> -Do a twerk challenge with your Lover or Daddy!<br>- Duets with the most hated and loved famous people!<br>- Gain followers by using the right filters!<br>- Collect trending items!<br><br>...And much more<br><br>But it&#39;s not just about the fun and games \u2013 in Streamer Rush, you&#39;ll also be able to upgrade your clothes, items, and talents while earning money by increasing your followers with each run. The more followers you get, the closer you&#39;ll get to achieving your dream of becoming a true streamer.<br><br>But be careful \u2013 the path to becoming a successful streamer is full of challenges and obstacles. Will you rise to the top and achieve your goals, or will you fall to the wayside as a mere clout chaser? The choice is yours in Streamer Rush! Come find out!",
